# Prelude to Puissance (jeuno 170), each completing option of 10045 but 13 (the main flow's), one level 91 Warrior each,
# with the Limit Breaker at cap 95, Dormant Powers Dislodged completed, accepted (a GM), no stone traded
# (tradeCompleted 0: completed all the same, a kept quirk). Option 0 (main): completed (the Soul Gem Clasp), Beyond
# Infinity not added: it answers in its available section, 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 0). Option 15 (c15): rejectedStartLB10 1
# (a local var), completed, Beyond Infinity not added: 10045 (91, 1, 5, 0, 1) (it reads the local var). Options 14, 19,
# 20, 21 (c14, c19, c20, c21): completed, Beyond Infinity added, set down at Horlais Peak (-511.459 159.004 -210.543,
# 139), Waughroon Shrine (-349.899 104.213 -260.150, 144), Balga's Dais (299.316 -123.591 353.760, 146), Qu'Bia Arena
# (-225.146 -24.250 20.057, 206): the char zones at the next tick.
